# say, emote, pmote and pose, and typo, rent, qui and delet. In the temple (3001): Decimus (10, a warrior),
# Quintus (25, a warrior), Heroic (51, a warrior) and Smokegod (60, a mage). pmote shows each player their own
# name as "you" and "Name's" as "your"; its match count carries over from one player to the next.
